{"english":[{"by":"machine","text":"That’s all. Coming home after work to watch the fish is pretty relaxing."}],"id":"2cc4ac971cebc42b","jyutping":"gam2 aa6 hai6 ze1 fong3 zo2 gung1 faan1 lei4 tai2 haa5 di1 jyu2 dou1 gei2 syu1 fuk6 gaa3 wo3","jyutpingBy":"corpus","text":"噉𠻺係啫。放咗工返來睇下啲魚都幾舒服𡃉喎。","words":[{"jyutping":"gam2","pos":"c","text":"噉"},{"jyutping":"aa6","pos":"d","text":"𠻺"},{"jyutping":"hai6","pos":"v","text":"係"},{"jyutping":"ze1","pos":"y","text":"啫"},{"jyutping":"fong3","pos":"v","text":"放"},{"jyutping":"zo2","pos":"u","text":"咗"},{"jyutping":"gung1","pos":"Ng","text":"工"},{"jyutping":"faan1 lei4","pos":"v","text":"返來"},{"jyutping":"tai2","pos":"v","text":"睇"},{"jyutping":"haa5","pos":"u","text":"下"},{"jyutping":"di1","pos":"q","text":"啲"},{"jyutping":"jyu2","pos":"n","text":"魚"},{"jyutping":"dou1","pos":"d","text":"都"},{"jyutping":"gei2","pos":"d","text":"幾"},{"jyutping":"syu1 fuk6","pos":"a","text":"舒服"},{"jyutping":"gaa3","pos":"y","text":"𡃉"},{"jyutping":"wo3","pos":"y","text":"喎"}]}
